OL,7,FWarning: This page contains distressing
OL,8,Fcontent
OL,10,FProsecutors describe Russell Brand as
OL,11,F"ruthless" and a "sexual predator" as
OL,12,Fthe 51-year-old goes on trial on
OL,13,Fcharges of rape and sexual assault
OL,15,FOpening the prosecution's case, Riel
OL,16,FKarmy-Jones KC tells Southwark Crown
OL,17,FCourt Brand had a "childlike"
OL,18,Fexpectation that his "voracious"
OL,19,Fdesires should be met
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
