OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FReferring to testimony from a former
OL,8,Ffriend of Brand's, Karmy-Jones says the
OL,9,Fcomedian and actor once said he wanted
OL,10,Fto "bed 5,000 women" - here's what else
OL,11,Fwe heard
OL,13,FBrand has pleaded not guilty to three
OL,14,Fcounts of rape, three counts of sexual
OL,15,Fassault and one count of indecent
OL,16,Fassault
OL,18,FThe allegations date from 1999-2009 and
OL,19,Fcome from six women who the prosecution
OL,20,Fsays "did not know each other" -
OL,21,Fthey're all entitled to lifelong
OL,22,Fanonymity
